    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this day, you suddenly took over a hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What! And there are cat employees too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then why not just open a hotel that can accommodate cats? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the furniture for the cats! And don't forget to prepare food for them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating a hotel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange rooms according to the guests' requests! When the guests check out, they will leave a rating. Try your best to improve the rating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorating the room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the room with various furniture and use four different room layouts to meet the needs of different guests! Work hard to expand the house and earn more money!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this day, you suddenly took over a hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What! And there are cat employees too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then why not just open a hotel that can accommodate cats? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the furniture for the cats! And don't forget to prepare food for them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating a hotel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange rooms according to the guests' requests! When the guests check out, they will leave a rating. Try your best to improve the rating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorating the room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the room with various furniture and use four different room layouts to meet the needs of different guests! Work hard to expand the house and earn more money!</p>",
